| **Separate config file (`config.js`)** | Keeps secret‑loading logic out of the main request handling code and makes it easy to unit‑test. |
| **`dotenv` is still present** | Developers can still run the app locally by creating a **`.env.example`** (never checked‑in) and loading values manually. |
