## 2. Recommendations (with ready‑to‑paste code)

Below is a **refactored `app.js`** that addresses the most critical items. Feel free to cherry‑pick the pieces you need.

### 2.1. Use environment variables & sensible defaults  

```js
// config.js (new file)
