## OWASP Top 10 Mapping & Findings

| OWASP Category | Current Status in *app.js* | Why it matters | Immediate Risk |
|----------------|----------------------------|----------------|----------------|
| **A01 – Broken Access Control** | No authentication/authorization at all. `/users` is publicly readable. | Public exposure of sensitive data is a classic broken‑access‑control flaw. | Low now (static data) but would be critical once real user data is added. |
